WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.284
After Harsha,

2
00:00:01.284 --> 00:00:03.070
one city became the prize

3
00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:04.444
of north India.

4
00:00:04.444 --> 00:00:05.759
Kannauj.

5
00:00:06.121 --> 00:00:07.644
The Palas of Bengal,

6
00:00:07.644 --> 00:00:10.410
the Gurjara-Pratiharas of the west,

7
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.022
and the Rashtrakutas of the

8
00:00:12.022 --> 00:00:14.489
Deccan, all fought over Kannauj.

9
00:00:14.824 --> 00:00:17.066
It controlled the Ganga valley,

10
00:00:17.066 --> 00:00:18.756
and carried the prestige of

11
00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:20.260
Harsha's capital.

12
00:00:20.948 --> 00:00:22.536
This era also saw the

13
00:00:22.536 --> 00:00:24.528
rise of Rajput clans,

14
00:00:24.528 --> 00:00:25.777
and the Chola navy in

15
00:00:25.777 --> 00:00:26.910
the south.

16
00:00:27.237 --> 00:00:28.508
Your turn.

17
00:00:28.508 --> 00:00:30.269
Which one wasn't?
